NAME
       mount9 - mount a 9P file server

SYNOPSIS
       mount9 <host> <port> <mountpoint>

DESCRIPTION
       Mounts a remote 9P file server so its files appear under
       MOUNTPOINT like any other filesystem.

EXAMPLES
       mount9 10.0.0.1 564 /mnt

SEE ALSO
       9p(1), mount(1), umount(1)
